WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.400
Give thanks!

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.410
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.820
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.990
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:48.480 --> 00:01:50.990
Someone once said...

00:01:51.690 --> 00:01:54.190
There's shellfish like abalone

00:01:54.190 --> 00:01:58.560
that when grilled, combines the 
flavors of abalone and marbled wagyu

00:01:58.560 --> 00:02:03.760
to produce the taste of a 
delicious, wonderful steak...

00:02:03.760 --> 00:02:08.170
Abeefalone!

00:02:11.570 --> 00:02:13.870
There are papayas

00:02:13.870 --> 00:02:17.240
like roasted sweet potatoes 
covered in honey...

00:02:17.240 --> 00:02:22.880
Roasted Sweet Papatoes!

00:02:23.550 --> 00:02:26.820
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:27.220 --> 00:02:33.660
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:36.460 --> 00:02:41.430
Toriko, Zebra, and Komatsu set out for 
the Gourmet Pyramid to get Mellow Cola.

00:02:42.470 --> 00:02:46.070
Toriko and Zebra forged ahead through 
the pyramid while searching for Komatsu,

00:02:46.070 --> 00:02:48.880
who was carried there first 
on a current of quicksand.

00:02:50.180 --> 00:02:55.080
However, during the course of their 
search, Zebra lost his voice.

00:02:55.920 --> 00:02:59.920
They encountered various 
Beasts inside the pyramid.

00:03:09.700 --> 00:03:11.400
Spiked Punch!

00:03:14.030 --> 00:03:18.500
Toriko and Zebra ate to 
replenish their strength

00:03:18.500 --> 00:03:20.270
as they continued through the pyramid.

00:03:23.710 --> 00:03:26.340
Meanwhile, Komatsu, separated 
from Toriko and Zebra,

00:03:26.340 --> 00:03:29.610
confronted a powerful Beast, Jowlcargot.

00:03:29.610 --> 00:03:32.580
With the power of the Melk 
knife, he carved out an escape.

00:03:34.250 --> 00:03:38.290
W-What's this room?!

00:03:39.720 --> 00:03:43.990
But then he was attacked by a mysterious 
creature that came out of a coffin.

00:03:50.940 --> 00:03:56.340
Komatsu grabbed the book that was 
in the room and barely got away.

00:03:59.640 --> 00:04:03.950
Shocking Showdown! Salamander Sphinx!

00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:24.130
I finally got my voice back.

00:04:24.130 --> 00:04:25.870
Is Komatsu alright?!

00:04:25.870 --> 00:04:27.540
Pray he is.

00:04:30.610 --> 00:04:33.010
Echo Map!

00:04:43.350 --> 00:04:44.420
This ain't good...

00:04:46.020 --> 00:04:49.160
Kid! Don't go that way!

00:05:11.580 --> 00:05:13.310
Howl Bullet!

00:05:16.480 --> 00:05:17.790
Zebra-san!

00:05:32.530 --> 00:05:34.640
The thing dispersed it...

00:05:34.640 --> 00:05:35.700
What about Komatsu?!

00:05:46.110 --> 00:05:48.880
We're not too far from the kid.

00:05:49.650 --> 00:05:51.180
Map off!

00:05:52.490 --> 00:05:53.650
Toriko...

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:56.490
We're gonna take a shortcut.

00:06:00.630 --> 00:06:02.460
H-Hey! Wait!

00:06:05.730 --> 00:06:09.840
Sound Bazooka!

00:06:39.260 --> 00:06:40.870
Knife!

00:06:48.270 --> 00:06:49.210
Komatsu!

00:06:49.210 --> 00:06:50.740
Toriko-san!

00:06:54.580 --> 00:07:00.150
Sounds like that little heartbeat 
is still goin' strong, huh, kid?

00:07:00.150 --> 00:07:03.620
Y-Yes, somehow, Zebra-san!

00:07:05.220 --> 00:07:09.230
The Sound Armor I shielded 
him with has been destroyed.

00:07:09.230 --> 00:07:12.230
Did he withstand a serious attack?

00:07:12.660 --> 00:07:14.530
Of all things,

00:07:14.530 --> 00:07:18.870
even in circumstances like these, 
bein' way ahead of me an' Toriko,

00:07:18.870 --> 00:07:21.170
his heartbeat an' sound of 
his breathing are normal.

00:07:22.240 --> 00:07:25.180
This kid is strong...

00:07:42.230 --> 00:07:44.190
This smell...

00:07:52.300 --> 00:07:54.000
I see...

00:07:54.500 --> 00:07:57.210
I can see how you dissipated my Howl Bullet.

00:07:59.340 --> 00:08:02.710
And are you the one that wrecked my armor?

00:08:02.710 --> 00:08:03.810
Uh-oh!

00:08:03.810 --> 00:08:07.080
Then you're gonna pay me back for it.

00:08:07.080 --> 00:08:08.750
And the price...

00:08:08.750 --> 00:08:11.320
Your flesh an' blood!

00:08:13.360 --> 00:08:16.060
Is Zebra seriously gonna make a go at it?!

00:08:16.060 --> 00:08:17.290
Run, Komatsu!

00:08:30.270 --> 00:08:32.510
Voice Missile!

00:08:44.280 --> 00:08:47.090
Voice Cutter!

00:09:02.100 --> 00:09:03.840
Come down...

00:09:08.310 --> 00:09:12.080
...Thunder Noise!

00:09:42.440 --> 00:09:43.980
Sound Wall!

00:09:51.420 --> 00:09:52.550
Zebra!

00:10:01.390 --> 00:10:04.900
This guy ain't even fazed...

00:10:05.400 --> 00:10:09.170
Even my Weak Point Voice can't find anything.

00:10:09.170 --> 00:10:12.800
Who figured somethin' like this even existed?

00:10:18.680 --> 00:10:20.480
No doubt about it...

00:10:21.410 --> 00:10:22.750
Zebra...

00:10:26.150 --> 00:10:29.650
This guy smells like cola!

00:10:29.650 --> 00:10:30.790
What?!

00:10:50.670 --> 00:10:55.110
I just remembered something about the 
ingredient we're after this time...

00:10:55.610 --> 00:10:59.550
This guy definitely smells like cola.

00:10:59.880 --> 00:11:04.150
Smells like cola? What're 
you talkin' about, Toriko?

00:11:05.320 --> 00:11:09.290
Hey, see... You just said that it's the 
cola is really delicious now, didn't you?

00:11:09.790 --> 00:11:13.600
You think it actually 
mellowed inside the pyramid?

00:11:14.130 --> 00:11:14.800
Yeah.

00:11:15.060 --> 00:11:16.930
What? Seriously?

00:11:16.930 --> 00:11:22.340
Or more precisely, inside the body of 
a certain Beast inside the pyramid.

00:11:23.040 --> 00:11:24.870
Inside the body of a Beast?

00:11:26.510 --> 00:11:33.580
The master of the Gourmet Pyramid. 
Its name is the Salamander Sphinx.

00:11:36.050 --> 00:11:41.390
The Mellow Cola matures inside of its body.

00:11:46.560 --> 00:11:49.860
The smell of cola is comin' off of its body!

00:11:51.030 --> 00:11:52.800
I'm positive...

00:11:52.800 --> 00:11:55.700
It's the master of the Gourmet Pyramid...

00:11:55.700 --> 00:11:57.570
Salamander Sphinx!

00:11:58.510 --> 00:12:02.840
Salamander Sphinx (Mammalian 
Beast) Capture Level 92

00:11:59.970 --> 00:12:03.040
Mellow Cola is inside its body!

00:12:03.040 --> 00:12:06.010
Then that's an easy riddle to solve.

00:12:06.010 --> 00:12:09.050
To get the cola,

00:12:09.050 --> 00:12:12.850
all we gotta do is bust this thing wide open!

00:12:24.660 --> 00:12:26.930
All this force from just 
lightly waving its paw!

00:12:27.330 --> 00:12:29.870
This ain't gonna be a pushover!

00:12:39.980 --> 00:12:44.620
It's fun bein' on the outside, ya know?!

00:12:58.130 --> 00:12:59.400
There's...

00:12:59.900 --> 00:13:03.670
...no doubt... It's that Beast!

00:13:04.600 --> 00:13:06.570
This book is incredible.

00:13:06.570 --> 00:13:10.440
I can't read the words, but I can 
tell what they're talking about.

00:13:11.310 --> 00:13:13.110
This is...

00:13:13.380 --> 00:13:15.280
...a cookbook!

00:13:30.060 --> 00:13:33.560
So the cola mellows in its body...

00:13:33.560 --> 00:13:37.600
Then its blood is Mellow Cola!

00:13:46.480 --> 00:13:48.010
It's not workin'!

00:14:01.960 --> 00:14:04.430
This book is really old...

00:14:04.430 --> 00:14:05.960
But these are new to me...

00:14:06.260 --> 00:14:10.470
I've never seen any of 
these ingredients before

00:14:10.470 --> 00:14:12.740
or methods of preparation.

00:14:12.740 --> 00:14:17.710
This has to be a "legacy of food" 
left behind by an ancient people.

00:14:21.640 --> 00:14:25.580
Then is the picture on that wall a 
recipe from the legacy of food, too?!

00:14:33.560 --> 00:14:35.120
Toriko-san! Zebra-san!

00:14:36.530 --> 00:14:39.230
Flying Fork!

00:14:54.010 --> 00:14:57.580
Machine Gun Voice!

00:15:07.960 --> 00:15:10.260
Leg Knife!

00:15:14.060 --> 00:15:17.060
Even if I have the power, 
I'm not fast enough?!

00:15:17.060 --> 00:15:20.830
You won't be able to hit it unless 
you're movin' at the speed of sound!

00:15:23.670 --> 00:15:28.140
Single Voice Cutter!

00:15:39.820 --> 00:15:40.650
Zebra!

00:15:42.860 --> 00:15:45.390
Fork Shield!

00:15:53.870 --> 00:15:56.140
Toriko-san! Zebra-san!

00:15:56.870 --> 00:15:58.370
It's strong...

00:15:58.370 --> 00:16:02.980
It ain't the Master of the 
Gourmet Pyramid for nothin'!

00:16:02.980 --> 00:16:05.040
Actin' all cocky...

00:16:09.150 --> 00:16:10.920
Bastard...

00:16:10.920 --> 00:16:15.490
We're hardly havin' any effect on it. 
At this rate, we'll never get its blood.

00:16:16.560 --> 00:16:18.090
It's tears!

00:16:19.090 --> 00:16:20.490
Not blood...

00:16:21.130 --> 00:16:25.430
The tears of that Beast are Mellow Cola!

00:16:25.630 --> 00:16:26.660
What?!

00:16:26.660 --> 00:16:27.630
Tears?!

00:16:28.630 --> 00:16:31.000
How do you know that, kid?!

00:16:31.000 --> 00:16:33.170
It's in this book!

00:16:33.170 --> 00:16:34.640
In a book?!

00:16:34.640 --> 00:16:36.970
Yes! Even how to get them!

00:16:36.970 --> 00:16:38.980
I found it in the pyramid!

00:16:38.980 --> 00:16:42.850
I think it's a cookbook 
written by an ancient race!

00:16:44.280 --> 00:16:48.290
The book shows ways to prepare and cook

00:16:48.290 --> 00:16:50.650
all kinds of Special Preparation Ingredients!

00:16:50.650 --> 00:16:53.320
Special Preparation Ingredients?!

00:16:54.890 --> 00:16:56.390
That's...

00:17:08.740 --> 00:17:12.380
More tough meat! Well, Zebra?!

00:17:22.750 --> 00:17:24.620
Zebra! You...

00:17:24.620 --> 00:17:27.090
Don't tell me that one you 
had just now was delicious?!

00:17:27.090 --> 00:17:28.890
It was delicious, wasn't it?!

00:17:30.460 --> 00:17:34.130
Our prey was a Special 
Preparation Ingredient!

00:17:34.630 --> 00:17:36.400
He didn't mean to, but by chance,

00:17:36.400 --> 00:17:40.340
he killed it in a way that 
increased its flavor.

00:17:40.740 --> 00:17:43.470
So most of the Beasts in 
the pyramid can be killed

00:17:43.470 --> 00:17:45.510
in a way that makes them taste good!

00:17:50.650 --> 00:17:51.950
Kid...

00:17:53.180 --> 00:17:57.750
You can read that mumbo-jumbo? Huh?!

00:17:58.050 --> 00:17:59.750
No, not at all...

00:18:00.050 --> 00:18:04.660
But I got the gist from the drawings 
and length of the sentences.

00:18:04.660 --> 00:18:05.730
Really?!

00:18:05.730 --> 00:18:10.930
Yes. Maybe it's because I read 
hundreds of cookbooks a year.

00:18:11.600 --> 00:18:12.670
Zebra...

00:18:13.130 --> 00:18:16.740
It could be said that we got 
this far thanks to Komatsu.

00:18:17.970 --> 00:18:22.980
It wasn't a coincidence. Komatsu 
led us to the Mellow Cola.

00:18:23.380 --> 00:18:26.710
Komatsu's talent is being 
loved by ingredients.

00:18:28.750 --> 00:18:30.420
Have faith in him!

00:18:30.880 --> 00:18:32.890
No matter how much he's loved,

00:18:32.890 --> 00:18:36.290
if we can't get a hold of that 
stuff, it don't mean a thing!

00:18:36.290 --> 00:18:40.990
Right! So I have a favor to ask you two.

00:18:40.990 --> 00:18:45.570
I'll tell you how to prepare... that 
is, how to get the Mellow Cola out!

00:18:46.930 --> 00:18:49.000
Cocky bastard!

00:18:51.440 --> 00:18:55.610
Kid! Tell me exactly what to do.

00:18:58.780 --> 00:19:01.450
If you don't, I'll kill you!

00:19:01.780 --> 00:19:03.150
R-Right!

00:19:05.320 --> 00:19:07.420
Alright. Ready?!

00:19:08.350 --> 00:19:11.320
Please, Toriko-san, Zebra-san!

00:19:18.800 --> 00:19:22.430
The question is, against an enemy of 
this level, will our strength hold out?

00:19:23.540 --> 00:19:26.570
I have 2,200,000 kilocalories left.

00:19:27.110 --> 00:19:30.180
Zebra is at 3,000,000 kilocalories...

00:19:30.980 --> 00:19:35.150
Both Zebra and I have close 
to 70% of our calories left.

00:19:36.010 --> 00:19:37.220
Is that enough?

00:19:45.890 --> 00:19:47.660
Let's go!

00:20:00.540 --> 00:20:02.510
Let the preparation begin!

00:20:06.680 --> 00:20:09.380
We give thanks for this food, let's eat!

00:20:13.580 --> 00:20:15.220
Yuuuu... Toriko!

00:20:15.220 --> 00:20:17.950
Potassium, manganese, calcium, 
starch, fructose, and dextrose

00:20:17.950 --> 00:20:20.790
Magnesium, iron, vitamins ABCDE

00:20:20.790 --> 00:20:23.630
Vanadium, sodium, glucosamine, chondroitin

00:20:23.630 --> 00:20:26.460
Carotintintin, lycopenpenpene, 
isoflavonvonvone

00:20:26.460 --> 00:20:29.200
Celery, goya, and green peas

00:20:29.200 --> 00:20:32.000
Shiitake, liver, eggplant, bell pepper

00:20:32.000 --> 00:20:34.700
What a shame to say "I don't 
even want to look at them!"

00:20:34.700 --> 00:20:36.370
Even if you hate it, gobble 
it down 3 times or 4 times

00:20:36.370 --> 00:20:37.810
and it'll be more and more

00:20:37.810 --> 00:20:39.140
Yuuuu... Toriko!

00:20:39.140 --> 00:20:41.940
Eat 'em up more! Eat 'em up more!

00:20:41.940 --> 00:20:44.810
More and more and more and 
more and more! Eat 'em all up!

00:20:44.810 --> 00:20:49.080
Delicious things are delicious!  
Not even giving them a chance…

00:20:49.080 --> 00:20:50.420
Such a waste!

00:20:50.420 --> 00:20:53.260
Gobble 'em down more! Gobble 'em down more!

00:20:53.260 --> 00:20:56.060
Majorly, deeply, plentifully, 
heartily, gobble 'em down!

00:20:56.060 --> 00:21:01.660
They enrich your body and spirit! 
Be grateful to your meals today!

00:21:01.660 --> 00:21:04.570
Thanks for the food! All done!

00:21:06.700 --> 00:21:08.270
Dishing with Tina!

00:21:08.670 --> 00:21:11.510
It's "Dishing with Tina", the talk 
show with a heaping helping of fun!

00:21:11.510 --> 00:21:15.910
Our guest today is Melk-san, the world's 
best and most enigmatic cutler!

00:21:15.910 --> 00:21:18.250
I wonder what he's like!

00:21:22.120 --> 00:21:23.320
Melk-san?!

00:21:24.420 --> 00:21:27.220
What an avant-garde appearance!

00:21:28.890 --> 00:21:30.490
A l-letter?

00:21:35.400 --> 00:21:37.870
"Dear Tina-sama, this is Melk.

00:21:38.300 --> 00:21:42.240
I entrusted this letter to my 
knife delivery assistant, Pochiko.

00:21:42.770 --> 00:21:47.880
I have my hands full with work and I'm 
not good at being in front of people,

00:21:47.880 --> 00:21:50.540
so I decline your offer to be on the show."

00:21:51.510 --> 00:21:53.710
It's not a show without a guest!

00:21:59.120 --> 00:22:01.090
"Leave it to me..."?

00:22:01.350 --> 00:22:05.730
Maybe you brought another 
guest in Melk-san's place?!

00:22:10.000 --> 00:22:12.930
Well! What a lovely, fair-complexioned guest!

00:22:12.930 --> 00:22:16.100
You're sure to be a guest that'll 
be the backbone of the show!

00:22:16.100 --> 00:22:18.340
Since you're full of calcium...

00:22:18.340 --> 00:22:22.110
What, you think I can do a talk 
show with milk replacing Melk?!

00:22:27.780 --> 00:22:34.250
Oh! A tale of hardship about preserving 
the taste of wine for many years...

00:22:34.250 --> 00:22:35.820
This is a <i>cork</i>!

00:22:38.990 --> 00:22:44.200
As smooth as silk... What's 
the secret of your beauty?

00:22:44.200 --> 00:22:47.600
In fact, this <i>is</i> silk!

00:22:47.600 --> 00:22:51.440
Don't you grunt at me! I can't make 
a show out of any of this stuff!

00:22:51.440 --> 00:22:52.370
Calm down!

00:22:52.370 --> 00:22:55.510
W-What the...?! L-Let me go!

00:22:56.310 --> 00:22:58.540
That's Cutler Melk's assistant, alright...

00:22:58.540 --> 00:23:01.180
His puns are as sharp as 
Tina's razor thin temper!

00:23:01.510 --> 00:23:04.720
But go on to the next 
segment! The next segment!

00:23:06.980 --> 00:23:10.070
This battle will come down to Komatsu's directions from the control tower.

00:23:10.070 --> 00:23:12.330
It's time to show what you've really got!

00:23:12.330 --> 00:23:14.160
Call the shots for the ultimate duo!

00:23:14.670 --> 00:23:17.490
Cooperative Cooking! Komatsu Manages Toriko and Zebra!

00:23:17.690 --> 00:23:19.270
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
